   984	  # + the framework marker on disk. INFERRED, never persisted.
   985	  _TEMPLATE_DELIVERY=1
   986	  _TEMPLATE_DELIVERY_SOURCE="OQ-5 amendment — no readable install-state, but .claude/.framework-version is present: existing framework install (INFERRED for THIS run only, never persisted)"
