  1007	# The GitHub handle a previous install recorded, or empty. Same trust class as
  1008	# every other install-state read: target-side, UNSIGNED, advisory. STRICTLY
  1009	# charset-validated before it is ever interpolated into a sed script —
  1010	# PLAN-183 §9.2 reproduced install.sh:1508 aborting with a 0-byte CODEOWNERS
