  1342	  # PLAN-161 U1: the sanitized manifest used to be mktemp'd INSIDE $BAK_DIR —
  1343	  # a write inside the target even under --dry-run (and the reason dry-run
  1344	  # could not keep classification alive once BAK_DIR creation was gated). It
