   877	# PLAN-166 F3 (ADR-155-AMEND-1) — resolve the RECORDED install ceremony with
   878	# a reader of its OWN, INDEPENDENT of the replay path: --no-replay sets
   879	# REPLAY=0 and the replay block above (incl. _read_install_state_request) is
