   883	# reader ALWAYS runs. Fail-SAFE (re-pass rc.4 t3/t5, corrected t9 P2 —
   884	# this comment previously described the OLD maintainer default): state
   885	# absent/unreadable/invalid (ALL pre-Wave-B installs) => "user" — root
   886	# files untouched; a pre-state MAINTAINER opts back in explicitly with
   887	# `--ceremony maintainer` (or CEO_UPGRADE_CEREMONY), and only an explicit
